# Deny everything, then re-allow exactly what the build needs. An allowlist is
# the only way to guarantee a stray file -- a key, a dump, a clone -- never
# lands in an image layer. .env matches the leading `*` and is deliberately
# never re-allowed: the API key reaches the container at run time via
# --env-file, never through the build context.
*
!entrypoint.sh
!pi-home/
!notes-skel/
!BOM.md
